        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8426, Single Cylinder Urban Modern Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Urban Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt is locked in on style. The mid-century modern feel of this arched square door lock makes it a new favorite among designers. The Single Cylinder Urban Modern Deadbolt made by Emtek is easy to install and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. Choose from some of the hottest finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Arched Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1⁄16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
