                "title": "Urban Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt",
                "description": "The Urban Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt is locked in on style. The mid-century modern feel of this arched square door lock makes it a new favorite among designers. The Single Cylinder Urban Modern Deadbolt made by Emtek is easy to install and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. Choose from some of the hottest finish colors.",
